1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This is School Plan Note, a web application
for elementary school teachers in Japan.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Teachers use it to write weekly lesson plans,
manage classroom tasks, and share class newsletters.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
This is our homepage, our privacy policy,
and our terms of service.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
These are the same URLs submitted
in this verification request.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Each teacher owns a single Google Spreadsheet
that stores their own lesson plan data.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
This add-on menu is provided
by the script.container.ui scope.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Opening the web application
starts the OAuth flow.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
This is the OAuth consent screen
for our application.

9
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The address bar shows the client ID of the
OAuth client submitted for verification.

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,000
The application requests the following scopes:
Google Sheets and Drive file access,

11
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Classroom courses read-only,
and Classroom announcements,

12
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:45,000
sending email on the user's behalf,
and the user's email address.

13
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Each of these scopes is demonstrated
in the following sections of this video.

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Teachers enter their weekly lesson plan
in this grid.

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
The data is written to the teacher's
own spreadsheet, shown here.

16
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:36,000
We use the spreadsheets scope only to read and write
this single database file, owned by the teacher.

17
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:42,000
We never access any other spreadsheet.

18
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:09,000
The app calls the Gemini API to draft the class
newsletter from the teacher's lesson plan.

19
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:16,000
This external HTTPS request requires
the script.external_request scope.

20
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:25,000
The API key is stored per user in Apps Script
properties and is never shared.

21
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,000
The newsletter is exported as a PDF file.

22
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:55,000
We request the drive.file scope,
not full Drive access.

23
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:03,000
This means the app can only see and manage
files it creates itself, such as this PDF.

24
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:10,000
It cannot read any of the teacher's
other Drive files.

25
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:28,000
Teachers can enable a daily reminder
for their unfinished tasks.

26
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Setting the delivery time creates a time-based
trigger, requiring the script.scriptapp scope.

27
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,000
The script.send_mail scope
is used to send this reminder.

28
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:54,000
The userinfo.email scope identifies the signed-in
teacher, so the reminder goes to that teacher only.

29
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:06,000
As you can see, the email is delivered
to the account that is signed in.

30
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:11,000
We never email anyone else.

31
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:29,000
The teacher links the app to their own
Google Classroom course.

32
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:38,000
We use classroom.courses.readonly only to list the
active courses the teacher already teaches,

33
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:43,000
so they can choose one from this dropdown.

34
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:51,000
We do not read student data, rosters,
coursework, or grades.

35
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:06,000
When the teacher clicks this button, the app posts
the schedule to the selected course as an announcement.

36
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:12,000
This is what the classroom.announcements
scope is used for.

37
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Here is the announcement
in Google Classroom.

38
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:30,000
The teacher always initiates the post. The app
never posts without an explicit action by the teacher.

39
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:49,000
To summarize: School Plan Note stores each teacher's
lesson plan in their own spreadsheet,

40
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:55,000
exports newsletters as PDF files
it creates itself,

41
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:01,000
sends reminders only to the signed-in teacher,

42
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:07,000
and posts announcements to the teacher's own
Classroom course when the teacher chooses to.

43
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:13,000
All requested scopes are used only for these
purposes, as described in our privacy policy.

44
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Thank you for reviewing our application.
